        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon de Fralda. Vullaby protege a parte traseira do corpo com ossos adequados que encontra e persegue Pokémon fracos. Seu grande apetite provoca rápidos surtos de crescimento, obrigando-o a trocar frequentemente os ossos que veste.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 0% M / 100% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Vullaby pode evoluir para Mandibuzz no nível 16 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Gust, Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Fury Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Pluck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Flatter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack, Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Iron Defense, Punishment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Defog</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Tailwind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Air Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Dark Pulse, Embargo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Brave Bird, Whirlwind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Attract, Mirror Move</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Assurance, Attract, Block, Brave Bird, Confide, Dark Pulse, Defog, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Wingbeat, Embargo, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Feather Dance, Fly, Foul Play, Frustration, Heat Wave, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Knock Off, Lash Out, Nasty Plot, Payback, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rock Tomb, Roost, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Torment, Toxic, U-turn, Uproar</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Fake Tears, Foul Play, Knock Off, Mean Look, Roost, Scary Face, Steel Wing, Toxic</p>",
